{"subject":"math2","year":2023,"count":22,"origin":"source","generator":"tools/work/build_analysis_from_blocks.py（source_blocks 原文照录，零编造）","analysis":[{"id":"math2-2023-1","num":1,"desc":"斜渐近线方程","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["斜渐近线方程为 $y=ax+b$。","$a=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{y}{x}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}\\ln(\\mathrm{e}+\\dfrac{1}{x-1})=1$","$b=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}(y-x)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}\\left[x\\ln(\\mathrm{e}+\\dfrac{1}{x-1})-x\\right]=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}x\\ln(1+\\dfrac{1}{\\mathrm{e}x-\\mathrm{e}})=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{x}{\\mathrm{e}x-\\mathrm{e}}=\\dfrac{1}{\\mathrm{e}}$","斜渐近线方程为 $y=x+\\dfrac{1}{\\mathrm{e}}$，故选（B）。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-2","num":2,"desc":"分段函数原函数","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["当 $x\\leqslant 0$ 时，$F(x)=\\displaystyle\\int f(x)\\mathrm{d}x=\\int\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1+x^{2}}}\\mathrm{d}x=\\ln(\\sqrt{1+x^{2}}+x)+C_{1}$，","当 $x>0$ 时，$F(x)=\\displaystyle\\int f(x)\\mathrm{d}x=\\int(x+1)\\cos x\\mathrm{d}x=(x+1)\\sin x+\\cos x+C_{2}$，","因为 $F(x)$ 在 $x=0$ 处连续，故 $F(0)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0^{-}}F(x)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0^{+}}F(x)$，即 $F(0)=C_{1}=C_{2}+1$。","任取 $C_{2}=0$，则 $F(0)=1,C_{1}=1$，得 $f(x)$ 的一个原函数 $F(x)=\\begin{cases}\\ln(\\sqrt{1+x^{2}}+x)+1, & x\\leqslant 0,\\\\ (x+1)\\sin x+\\cos x, & x>0,\\end{cases}$，故应选（D）。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-3","num":3,"desc":"数列极限","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["在 $x\\in\\left(0,\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\right)$ 时，$\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}x<\\sin x$，即 $x_{n+1}=\\sin x_{n}>\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}x_{n}$，$y_{n+1}=\\dfrac{1}{2}y_{n}$","因此 $\\dfrac{y_{n+1}}{x_{n+1}}<\\dfrac{\\frac{1}{2}y_{n}}{\\frac{2}{\\pi}x_{n}}=\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\dfrac{y_{n}}{x_{n}}<\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\right)^{2}\\dfrac{y_{n-1}}{x_{n-1}}<\\cdots<\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\right)^{n}\\dfrac{y_{1}}{x_{1}}$，故 $\\lim\\limits_{n\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{y_{n}}{x_{n}}=0$。","即 $n\\to\\infty$ 时，$y_{n}$ 是 $x_{n}$ 的高阶无穷小，选（B）。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-4","num":4,"desc":"二阶常系数线性微分方程","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["若要在实数域内有界，必须要求解中不含指数形式，当 $a=0,b>0$ 的时候，特征根为 $\\lambda=\\pm\\sqrt{b}i$，此时通解为 $y=C_{1}\\cos\\sqrt{b}x+C_{2}\\sin\\sqrt{b}x$，故有界，选 C。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-5","num":5,"desc":"参数方程求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["由于 $f'(0)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{f(x)-f(0)}{x-0}=\\lim\\limits_{t\\to 0}\\dfrac{|t|\\sin t-0}{2t+|t|-0}=\\lim\\limits_{t\\to 0}\\dfrac{|t|\\sin t}{2t+|t|}=0$。故排除 A 选项。","当 $t>0$ 时，$\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}y/\\mathrm{d}t}{\\mathrm{d}x/\\mathrm{d}t}=\\dfrac{\\sin t+t\\cos t}{3}$。","当 $t<0$ 时，$\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}y/\\mathrm{d}t}{\\mathrm{d}x/\\mathrm{d}t}=-\\dfrac{(\\sin t+t\\cos t)}{1}=-(\\sin t+t\\cos t)$。","可见，$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0^{+}}f'(x)=\\lim\\limits_{t\\to 0^{+}}\\dfrac{\\sin t+t\\cos t}{3}=0=f'(0)$，$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0^{-}}f'(x)=\\lim\\limits_{t\\to 0^{-}}-(\\sin t+t\\cos t)=0=f'(0)$。即 $f'(x)$ 在 $x=0$ 处连续，排除选项 B。","$f_{+}''(0)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0^{+}}\\dfrac{f'(x)-f'(0)}{x-0}=\\lim\\limits_{t\\to 0^{+}}\\dfrac{\\frac{\\sin t+t\\cos t}{3}}{3t}=\\lim\\limits_{t\\to 0^{+}}\\dfrac{\\sin t+t\\cos t}{9t}=\\dfrac{2}{9}$","$f_{-}''(0)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0^{-}}\\dfrac{f'(x)-f'(0)}{x-0}=\\lim\\limits_{t\\to 0^{-}}\\dfrac{-(\\sin t+t\\cos t)-0}{t}=-2$。","由于 $f_{+}''(0)\\neq f_{-}''(0)$，所以 $f''(0)$ 不存在，即选项 C 正确。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-6","num":6,"desc":"反常积分","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["$f(\\alpha)=\\displaystyle\\int_{2}^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{x(\\ln x)^{\\alpha+1}}\\mathrm{d}x$ 收敛，则 $\\alpha>0$。","$f(\\alpha)=\\displaystyle\\int_{2}^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{x(\\ln x)^{\\alpha+1}}\\mathrm{d}x=-\\dfrac{1}{\\alpha}(\\ln x)^{-\\alpha}\\Big|_{2}^{+\\infty}=\\dfrac{1}{\\alpha}(\\ln 2)^{-\\alpha}$。","$f'(\\alpha)=-\\dfrac{1}{\\alpha^{2}}(\\ln 2)^{-\\alpha}-\\dfrac{1}{\\alpha}\\ln\\ln 2\\,(\\ln 2)^{-\\alpha}$。","令 $f'(\\alpha)=0$，则有唯一驻点 $\\alpha=-\\dfrac{1}{\\ln\\ln 2}$，即 $\\alpha_{0}=-\\dfrac{1}{\\ln\\ln 2}$，选（A）。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-7","num":7,"desc":"极值点判定","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["$f'(x)=(x^{2}+2x+a)\\mathrm{e}^{x}$，$f''(x)=(x^{2}+4x+2+a)\\mathrm{e}^{x}$。由于 $f(x)$ 无极值点，所以 $f'(x)\\geqslant 0$，即 $x^{2}+2x+a\\geqslant 0$，判别式 $\\Delta=4-4a\\leqslant 0$，解得 $a\\geqslant 1$；","又 $y=f(x)$ 有拐点，所以 $f''(x)$ 有零点，即 $x^{2}+4x+2+a=0$ 有零点，判别式 $\\Delta=16-4(a+2)\\geqslant 0$，解得 $a\\leqslant 2$。","当 $a=2$ 时，$f''(x)=(x^{2}+4x+4)\\mathrm{e}^{x}$ 有唯一零点 $x=-2$，计算得到 $f^{(4)}(-2)=2$，故此时无拐点。","综上 $a$ 的取值范围是：$[1,2)$，选（C）。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-8","num":8,"desc":"分块矩阵伴随矩阵","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["由于 $\\begin{pmatrix}A&E\\\\ O&B\\end{pmatrix}^{*}=\\begin{vmatrix}A&E\\\\ O&B\\end{vmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}A&E\\\\ O&B\\end{pmatrix}^{-1}$，","而 $\\begin{vmatrix}A&E\\\\ O&B\\end{vmatrix}=|A||B|$，$\\begin{pmatrix}A&E\\\\ O&B\\end{pmatrix}^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}A^{-1}&-A^{-1}B^{-1}\\\\ O&B^{-1}\\end{pmatrix}$，$|A|A^{-1}=A^{*}$，$|B|B^{-1}=B^{*}$","所以 $\\begin{pmatrix}A&E\\\\ O&B\\end{pmatrix}^{*}=|A||B|\\begin{pmatrix}A^{-1}&-A^{-1}B^{-1}\\\\ O&B^{-1}\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}|A||B|A^{-1}&-|A||B|A^{-1}B^{-1}\\\\ O&|A||B|B^{-1}\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}|B|A^{*}&-A^{*}B^{*}\\\\ O&|A|B^{*}\\end{pmatrix}$，选（D）。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-9","num":9,"desc":"二次型规范形","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["$f(x_{1},x_{2},x_{3})=(x_{1}+x_{2})^{2}+(x_{1}+x_{3})^{2}-4(x_{2}-x_{3})^{2}=2x_{1}^{2}-3x_{2}^{2}-3x_{3}^{2}+2x_{1}x_{2}+2x_{1}x_{3}+8x_{2}x_{3}$","$=2\\left(x_{1}+\\dfrac{1}{2}x_{2}+\\dfrac{1}{2}x_{3}\\right)^{2}-\\dfrac{7}{2}(x_{2}-x_{3})^{2}$","由上述配方法可知，该二次型的正、负惯性指数分别为 1，1，所以选（B）。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-10","num":10,"desc":"向量组线性表示","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["易知，$\\alpha_{1}$、$\\alpha_{2}$ 线性无关，$\\beta_{1}$、$\\beta_{2}$ 线性无关，由 $\\begin{vmatrix}1&2&1\\\\ 2&1&5\\\\ 3&1&8\\end{vmatrix}=0,\\begin{vmatrix}2&1&1\\\\ 5&0&5\\\\ 9&1&8\\end{vmatrix}=0$ 可知，","$\\gamma$ 可由 $\\alpha_{1}$、$\\alpha_{2}$ 线性表示，也可由 $\\beta_{1}$、$\\beta_{2}$ 线性表示，故选（D）。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-11","num":11,"desc":"等价无穷小","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["由已知 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{f(x)}{g(x)}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{ax+bx^{2}+\\ln(1+x)}{\\mathrm{e}^{x^{2}}-\\cos x}=1$","泰勒展开得 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{ax+bx^{2}+x-\\dfrac{1}{2}x^{2}+o(x^{2})}{1+x^{2}+o(x^{2})-\\left[1-\\dfrac{1}{2}x^{2}+o(x^{2})\\right]}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to 0}\\dfrac{(a+1)x+(b-\\dfrac{1}{2})x^{2}+o(x^{2})}{\\dfrac{3}{2}x^{2}+o(x^{2})}=1$","则 $a+1=0$，$b-\\dfrac{1}{2}=\\dfrac{3}{2}$，即 $a=-1$，$b=2$","故 $ab=-2$。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-12","num":12,"desc":"变限积分求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["$S=\\displaystyle\\int_{-\\sqrt{3}}^{\\sqrt{3}}\\sqrt{1+\\left[y'(x)\\right]^{2}}\\mathrm{d}x=2\\int_{0}^{\\sqrt{3}}\\sqrt{1+3-x^{2}}\\mathrm{d}x=2\\int_{0}^{\\sqrt{3}}\\sqrt{4-x^{2}}\\mathrm{d}x$","$\\xlongequal{x=2\\sin u}2\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}4\\cos^{2}u\\mathrm{d}u=4\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}(1+\\cos 2u)\\mathrm{d}u=4\\left(u+\\dfrac{1}{2}\\sin 2u\\Big|_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}\\right)=\\dfrac{4\\pi}{3}+\\sqrt{3}$。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-13","num":13,"desc":"隐函数求偏导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["$x=1,y=1$ 时，得到 $z=0$","等式两边对 $x$ 求偏导，$\\mathrm{e}^{z}z_{x}'+z+xz_{x}'=2$，代入 $x=1,y=1$，$z=0$ 得到 $z_{x}'|_{(1,1)}=1$","等式两边继续对 $x$ 求偏导 $e^{z}(z_{x}')^{2}+e^{z}z_{x}''+z_{x}'+z_{x}'+xz_{x}''=0$","代入 $x=1,y=1$，$z=0$，$z_{x}'|_{(1,1)}=1$，得到 $\\dfrac{\\partial^{2}z}{\\partial x^{2}}\\Big|_{(1,1)}=-\\dfrac{3}{2}$。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-14","num":14,"desc":"隐函数求导","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["$9x^{2}=6y^{2}y'+5y^{4}y'$，当 $x=1$ 时，$y=1$，所以 $y'=\\dfrac{9}{11}$，则法线斜率为 $-\\dfrac{11}{9}$。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-15","num":15,"desc":"定积分换元","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["$\\displaystyle\\int_{1}^{3}f(x)\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_{1}^{2}f(x)\\mathrm{d}x+\\int_{2}^{3}f(x)\\mathrm{d}x=\\int_{1}^{2}f(x)\\mathrm{d}x+\\int_{0}^{1}f(x+2)\\mathrm{d}(x+2)$","$=\\displaystyle\\int_{1}^{2}f(x)\\mathrm{d}x+\\int_{0}^{1}f(x+2)\\mathrm{d}(x)=\\int_{1}^{2}f(x)\\mathrm{d}x+\\int_{0}^{1}f(x)+x\\mathrm{d}x$","$=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{2}f(x)\\mathrm{d}x+\\int_{0}^{1}x\\mathrm{d}x=\\dfrac{1}{2}$"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-16","num":16,"desc":"含参线性方程组有解","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["已知 $\\begin{vmatrix}a&0&1\\\\ 1&a&1\\\\ 1&2&a\\end{vmatrix}=a^{3}+2-a-2a=4$，即 $a^{3}-3a-2=0$，解得 $a=2$ 或 $a=-1$","(1) 当 $a=2$ 时，对增广矩阵作初等行变换：","$\\overline{A}=\\begin{pmatrix}2&0&1&1\\\\ 1&2&1&0\\\\ 1&2&2&0\\\\ 2&b&0&2\\end{pmatrix}\\rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}1&2&1&0\\\\ 0&-4&-1&1\\\\ 0&0&1&0\\\\ 0&b&-1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}1&2&1&0\\\\ 0&1&\\dfrac{1}{4}&-\\dfrac{1}{4}\\\\ 0&0&1&0\\\\ 0&0&-1-\\dfrac{1}{4}b&1+\\dfrac{1}{4}b\\end{pmatrix}$","方程组有解，$r(\\overline{A})=r(A)$，$b=-4$，则 $\\begin{vmatrix}1&a&1\\\\ 1&2&a\\\\ a&b&0\\end{vmatrix}=a^{3}+b-2a-ab=8$；","(2) 当 $a=-1$ 时，对增广矩阵作初等行变换：","$\\overline{A}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&0&1&1\\\\ 1&-1&1&0\\\\ 1&2&-1&0\\\\ -1&b&0&2\\end{pmatrix}\\rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&-1&-1\\\\ 0&-1&2&1\\\\ 0&2&0&1\\\\ 0&b&-1&1\\end{pmatrix}\\rightarrow\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&-1&-1\\\\ 0&1&-2&-1\\\\ 0&0&4&3\\\\ 0&0&2b-1&b+1\\end{pmatrix}$","方程组有解，$r(\\overline{A})=r(A)$，$b=\\dfrac{7}{2}$，则 $\\begin{vmatrix}1&a&1\\\\ 1&2&a\\\\ a&b&0\\end{vmatrix}=a^{3}+b-2a-ab=8$；","综上所述，行列式 $\\begin{vmatrix}1&a&1\\\\ 1&2&a\\\\ a&b&0\\end{vmatrix}=8$。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-17","num":17,"desc":"一阶微分方程几何应用","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["(1) 设在点 $P$ 处的切线为 $Y-y=y'(X-x)$，在 $y$ 轴上的截距为 $y-xy'$，","点 $P$ 到 $y$ 轴距离为 $x$，所以可列微分方程 $x=y-xy'$，整理得 $y'=\\dfrac{y}{x}-1$，","解得 $y=-x\\ln x+Cx$，又因为曲线过点 $\\left(\\mathrm{e}^{2},0\\right)$，得 $C=2$，","所以 $y=-x\\ln x+2x$。","(2) 切线为 $Y-y=y'(X-x)$ 在 $y$ 轴上的截距为 $y-xy'$，在 $x$ 轴上的截距为 $x-\\dfrac{y}{y'}$，","所以三角形面积为 $S=\\dfrac{1}{2}|y-xy'|\\left|x-\\dfrac{y}{y'}\\right|$，代入 $y=-x\\ln x+2x$，$y'=1-\\ln x$，","化简为 $S=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\dfrac{x^{2}}{\\ln x-1}$，$\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}S}{\\mathrm{d}x}=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\dfrac{2x(\\ln x-1)-x}{(\\ln x-1)^{2}}=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\dfrac{x(2\\ln x-3)}{(\\ln x-1)^{2}}$，","当 $x<\\mathrm{e}^{\\frac{3}{2}}$ 时 $\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}S}{\\mathrm{d}x}<0$，当 $x>\\mathrm{e}^{\\frac{3}{2}}$ 时 $\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}S}{\\mathrm{d}x}>0$，","所以 $\\left(\\mathrm{e}^{\\frac{3}{2}},\\dfrac{1}{2}\\mathrm{e}^{\\frac{3}{2}}\\right)$ 取到面积最小值，最小值为 $S=\\mathrm{e}^{3}$。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-18","num":18,"desc":"二元函数极值","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["$f_{x}'(x,y)=\\mathrm{e}^{\\cos y}+x,\\ f_{y}'(x,y)=x\\mathrm{e}^{\\cos y}(-\\sin y)$","令 $f_{x}'(x,y)=f_{y}'(x,y)=0$","解得 $\\begin{cases}x=-\\mathrm{e}\\\\ y=2k\\pi\\end{cases}$，$\\begin{cases}x=-\\mathrm{e}^{-1}\\\\ y=(2k+1)\\pi\\end{cases}$，其中 $k=0,\\pm1,\\pm2,\\cdots$","又 $f_{xx}''(x,y)=1,\\ f_{xy}''(x,y)=\\mathrm{e}^{\\cos y}(-\\sin y),\\ f_{yy}''(x,y)=x\\mathrm{e}^{\\cos y}(\\sin^{2}y-\\cos y)$","当 $x=-\\mathrm{e}$，$y=2k\\pi$ 时，$A=1,B=0,C=\\mathrm{e}^{2},AC-B^{2}>0$，且 $A>0$，则存在极小值，","极小值为 $f(-\\mathrm{e},2k\\pi)=-\\dfrac{\\mathrm{e}^{2}}{2}$。","当 $x=-\\mathrm{e}^{-1}$，$y=(2k-1)\\pi$ 时，$A=1,B=0,C=-\\mathrm{e}^{-2},AC-B^{2}<0$，则不存在极值。","故函数 $f(x,y)$ 存在极小值，极小值为 $f(-\\mathrm{e},2k\\pi)=-\\dfrac{\\mathrm{e}^{2}}{2}$。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-19","num":19,"desc":"反常积分","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["(1) $S=\\displaystyle\\int_{1}^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{x\\sqrt{1+x^{2}}}\\mathrm{d}x\\xlongequal{x=\\tan t}\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\dfrac{1}{\\tan t\\sec t}\\sec^{2}t\\,\\mathrm{d}t=\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\csc t\\,\\mathrm{d}t$","$=\\ln|\\csc t-\\cot t|\\Big|_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}=\\ln(\\sqrt{2}+1)$","(2) $V=\\pi\\displaystyle\\int_{1}^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{x^{2}(1+x^{2})}\\mathrm{d}x=\\pi\\int_{1}^{+\\infty}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{x^{2}}-\\dfrac{1}{1+x^{2}}\\right)\\mathrm{d}x$","$=\\pi\\left(-\\dfrac{1}{x}-\\arctan x\\right)\\Big|_{1}^{+\\infty}=\\pi\\left(1-\\dfrac{\\pi}{4}\\right)$"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-20","num":20,"desc":"二重积分极坐标","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["利用极坐标：设 $x=r\\cos\\theta,\\ y=r\\sin\\theta,\\ \\mathrm{d}x\\mathrm{d}y=r\\mathrm{d}r\\mathrm{d}\\theta$，根据 $x^{2}+y^{2}-xy=1$，$x^{2}+y^{2}-xy=2$，$y=\\sqrt{3}x$，","从而得到：$0\\leqslant\\theta\\leqslant\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}$，$\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}}\\leqslant r\\leqslant\\sqrt{\\dfrac{2}{1-\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}}$","所以 $\\displaystyle\\iint_{D}\\dfrac{1}{3x^{2}+y^{2}}\\mathrm{d}x\\mathrm{d}y=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}\\mathrm{d}\\theta\\int_{\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}}}^{\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{1-\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}}}\\dfrac{r}{r^{2}(3\\cos^{2}\\theta+\\sin^{2}\\theta)}\\mathrm{d}r$","$=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}\\dfrac{\\ln\\sqrt{2}}{3\\cos^{2}\\theta+\\sin^{2}\\theta}\\mathrm{d}\\theta=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}\\dfrac{\\ln\\sqrt{2}(\\cos^{2}\\theta+\\sin^{2}\\theta)}{3\\cos^{2}\\theta+\\sin^{2}\\theta}\\mathrm{d}\\theta$","$=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}\\dfrac{\\ln\\sqrt{2}(1+\\tan^{2}\\theta)}{3+\\tan^{2}\\theta}\\mathrm{d}\\theta=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}\\dfrac{\\ln\\sqrt{2}}{3+\\tan^{2}\\theta}\\mathrm{d}\\tan\\theta=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}\\ln 2}{24}\\pi$"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-21","num":21,"desc":"泰勒公式","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["(1) 由泰勒公式可知 $\\begin{cases}f(a)=f(0)+f'(0)a+\\dfrac{f''(\\xi_{1})}{2}a^{2},\\ \\xi_{1}\\in(0,a),\\\\ f(-a)=f(0)-f'(0)a+\\dfrac{f''(\\xi_{2})}{2}a^{2},\\ \\xi_{2}\\in(-a,0),\\end{cases}$","两式相加得 $f(a)+f(-a)=\\dfrac{f''(\\xi_{1})+f''(\\xi_{2})}{2}a^{2}$，","再由平均值定理可知存在 $\\xi\\in(-a,a)$ 使得 $f''(\\xi)=\\dfrac{f''(\\xi_{1})+f''(\\xi_{2})}{2}$，","即存在 $\\xi\\in(-a,a)$ 使得 $f''(\\xi)=\\dfrac{1}{a^{2}}[f(a)+f(-a)]$。","(2) 由 $f(x)$ 在 $(-a,a)$ 内取得极值，故存在 $c\\in(-a,a)$ 使得 $f'(c)=0$。","由泰勒公式可知 $\\begin{cases}f(a)=f(c)+f'(c)(a-c)+\\dfrac{f''(\\eta_{1})}{2}(a-c)^{2},\\ \\eta_{1}\\in(c,a),\\\\ f(-a)=f(c)+f'(c)(-a-c)+\\dfrac{f''(\\eta_{2})}{2}(a+c)^{2},\\ \\eta_{2}\\in(-a,c),\\end{cases}$","两式相减得 $f(a)-f(-a)=\\dfrac{f''(\\eta_{1})}{2}(a-c)^{2}-\\dfrac{f''(\\eta_{2})}{2}(a+c)^{2}$，","令 $|f''(\\eta)|=\\max\\left\\{|f''(\\eta_{1})|,|f''(\\eta_{2})|\\right\\}$，则","$|f(a)-f(-a)|\\leqslant\\left|\\dfrac{f''(\\eta)}{2}\\right|\\left[(a-c)^{2}+(a+c)^{2}\\right]=\\left|\\dfrac{f''(\\eta)}{2}\\right|\\left(2a^{2}+2c^{2}\\right)\\leqslant 2a^{2}|f''(\\eta)|$","即存在 $\\eta\\in(-a,a)$ 使得 $|f''(\\eta)|\\geqslant\\dfrac{1}{2a^{2}}|f(a)-f(-a)|$。"]}]},{"id":"math2-2023-22","num":22,"desc":"矩阵对角化","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2023数学二真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["(1) 由矩阵的运算规律可知，$A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&1\\\\ 2&-1&1\\\\ 0&1&-1\\end{pmatrix}$；","(2) 令 $|\\lambda E-A|=0$，$\\begin{vmatrix}\\lambda-1&-1&-1\\\\ -2&\\lambda+1&-1\\\\ 0&-1&\\lambda+1\\end{vmatrix}=(\\lambda-2)(\\lambda+1)(\\lambda+2)=0$","得矩阵 $A$ 的特征值为 $\\lambda_{1}=2,\\lambda_{2}=-1,\\lambda_{3}=-2$。","解方程 $(\\lambda_{i}E-A)\\boldsymbol{x}=0$ 得矩阵 $A$ 对应的特征向量为 $\\alpha_{1}=(4,3,1)^{\\mathrm{T}},\\alpha_{2}=(1,0,-2)^{\\mathrm{T}},\\alpha_{3}=(0,1,-1)^{\\mathrm{T}}$。","可得 $P=\\begin{pmatrix}4&1&0\\\\ 3&0&1\\\\ 1&-2&-1\\end{pmatrix}$，$\\Lambda=\\begin{pmatrix}2& &\\\\ &-1&\\\\ & &-2\\end{pmatrix}$，使得 $P^{-1}AP=\\Lambda$。"]}]}]}